# POST-RUN additions — 2026-08-23, added during review of the G1 evidence

Separate from MANIFEST.sha256 on purpose. That manifest covers the seven
RUN-TIME artifacts of 2026-08-22 and is unchanged. These three files were
created AFTER the run and are not run-time evidence:

  06_POSTRUN_provenance.txt          identities re-derived from the still-clean
                                     pinned clone, plus the exact command lines
                                     transcribed from the session record
  07_POSTRUN_verify_criteria.py      asserts the G1 criteria against the
                                     RECORDED outputs; loads no model, imports
                                     no TensorFlow, re-runs nothing
  08_POSTRUN_verify_criteria.out.txt its output: 7/7 negative self-test
                                     mutations rejected, then PASS

Neither manifest lists itself. Verify with:
  shasum -a 256 -c <(grep -E '^[0-9a-f]{64}  ' MANIFEST-POSTRUN.sha256)

